WEBVTT

01:40.160 --> 01:42.960
Everyone outside is on the move.

01:44.920 --> 01:46.360
The city will soon be in chaos.

01:47.120 --> 01:48.320
Those with somewhere to go

01:48.960 --> 01:50.600
are all thinking of fleeing.

01:53.640 --> 01:54.800
TRAVEL PASS

01:57.760 --> 01:59.240
The realm is in peril,

01:59.920 --> 02:01.400
yet I still have a place to go.

02:02.280 --> 02:03.480
Thank you, sir.

02:03.560 --> 02:05.680
I know what's on your mind.

02:06.280 --> 02:08.680
But at your age,

02:08.759 --> 02:10.720
it's too soon to speak of life and death.

02:13.000 --> 02:14.120
But, sir,

02:14.800 --> 02:15.840
I've harmed people.

02:17.000 --> 02:18.160
Innocent people.

02:22.080 --> 02:24.480
Heaven and earth are vast,

02:26.080 --> 02:27.720
and life is long.

02:28.600 --> 02:32.160
Go farther,

02:33.120 --> 02:35.320
see more of the world,

02:36.720 --> 02:38.080
and learn to forgive yourself.

02:38.160 --> 02:39.120
I believe

02:40.160 --> 02:41.880
those you wronged have forgiven you.

02:47.200 --> 02:48.480
Come on.

02:52.800 --> 02:54.560
The men escorting you
are all old friends of mine.

02:55.120 --> 02:56.640
They'll keep you safe on the road.

03:12.760 --> 03:13.600
Move.

03:30.400 --> 03:32.880
RICE AND GRAIN STORE

03:34.360 --> 03:35.200
What?

03:35.280 --> 03:36.800
Why is the gate closed?

03:38.440 --> 03:39.360
Right. Why's it shut?

03:39.440 --> 03:40.200
SILK AND SATIN

03:40.280 --> 03:41.480
-Sir.
-What's going on?

03:41.560 --> 03:42.640
Why have you stopped?

03:42.720 --> 03:44.160
There's no way ahead.

03:44.240 --> 03:46.200
‎-What happened?
‎-What's going on?

03:46.280 --> 03:47.200
Look.

03:47.280 --> 03:49.240
-What's all this?
-Why are there so many people down?

03:49.320 --> 03:51.200
-What's happening here?
-How are we meant to get out?

03:51.280 --> 03:52.560
-Exactly.
-This is absurd.

03:52.640 --> 03:54.240
-We're completely stuck.
-What’s wrong with them?

03:58.440 --> 03:59.680
‎This is strange.

04:00.280 --> 04:01.320
‎What is this?

04:01.400 --> 04:02.320
The gate is shut.

04:03.960 --> 04:05.000
Starting today,

04:05.080 --> 04:06.720
entry and exit are only permitted

04:06.800 --> 04:08.360
through Yanping Gate.

04:08.440 --> 04:10.320
-That'll be a long detour!
-Exactly.

04:10.400 --> 04:11.240
Look, we're already…

04:11.320 --> 04:13.440
‎-Let us out!
‎-Why are they doing this?

04:32.160 --> 04:37.280
ZHAO'S TAVERN

04:42.560 --> 04:43.960
‎-I'll help you.
‎-Come here.

04:54.840 --> 04:59.000
FLATBREAD

04:59.080 --> 05:00.800
‎Open the door. Open it!

05:01.560 --> 05:02.520
‎Open the door!

05:09.920 --> 05:10.960
How can I help you?

05:11.040 --> 05:13.920
I'll take 700 flatbreads
and 350 bowls of noodle soup.

05:14.600 --> 05:15.640
Well…

05:16.680 --> 05:18.440
-I…
-You refuse?

05:19.560 --> 05:21.640
My… My shop is too small.

05:24.640 --> 05:26.680
I'll give you time and money.

05:29.840 --> 05:32.160
So the Tiemo people
entered the city just like that.

05:32.240 --> 05:33.120
WONTONS

05:33.200 --> 05:35.080
-It feels like a dream.
-Exactly.

05:35.160 --> 05:37.000
-What do we do?
-Flee?

05:37.080 --> 05:38.000
Flee?

05:38.080 --> 05:39.680
The city gates are all in their hands.

05:39.760 --> 05:41.960
Who knows how many
Tiemo soldiers lie outside?

05:42.040 --> 05:44.400
Exactly. We're just common folk.

05:44.480 --> 05:46.080
Where can we run? How would we run?

05:46.960 --> 05:48.600
Then what do we do?

05:51.000 --> 05:52.240
I'm staying.

05:52.320 --> 05:54.280
If our army fights its way back,

05:54.360 --> 05:56.000
I can kill a few Tiemo scoundrels myself.

05:56.640 --> 05:58.120
That's what I was thinking.

05:59.400 --> 06:01.080
But first, eat.

06:02.000 --> 06:03.280
Sir.

06:03.360 --> 06:04.840
-Three bowls of wontons.
-All right.

06:07.040 --> 06:08.440
Once the Tiemo army arrives,

06:08.520 --> 06:10.920
we commoners
will be the ones who suffer the most.

06:12.440 --> 06:13.520
Truly.

06:14.120 --> 06:15.160
Tell me about it.

06:16.800 --> 06:19.960
Who knows how many more meals
we'll get from this stall?

06:20.040 --> 06:21.000
Eat while we still can.

06:21.080 --> 06:21.920
WONTON

06:22.000 --> 06:23.400
Your wontons are ready.

06:23.480 --> 06:25.360
-Come on.
-Careful. They're hot.

06:25.440 --> 06:26.400
All right.

06:27.280 --> 06:28.600
-Thanks, sir.
-We've got it.

06:28.680 --> 06:29.640
Thank you, sir.

07:07.400 --> 07:08.440
Sir.

07:09.600 --> 07:10.640
Sir?

07:12.680 --> 07:13.960
You haven't eaten, have you?

07:14.680 --> 07:16.040
Come have a bowl of wontons.

07:18.280 --> 07:19.440
I don't want wontons.

07:21.200 --> 07:23.720
I have no appetite, and no money.

07:24.760 --> 07:26.520
What money?

07:26.600 --> 07:27.440
Come.

07:28.000 --> 07:30.360
It's only a bowl of food. Sit.

07:32.040 --> 07:33.840
With the Tiemo army approaching,

07:33.920 --> 07:35.080
money means nothing.

07:35.160 --> 07:36.440
Consider this a small favor.

07:45.920 --> 07:47.840
If you knew what I've done,

07:48.920 --> 07:50.160
you wouldn't help me.

07:56.600 --> 07:59.920
Xie Huai'an said
you'd understand everything

08:00.000 --> 08:00.920
when you saw this rice.

08:03.240 --> 08:04.480
You must stay strong.

08:11.520 --> 08:12.440
I said I'd cook it,

08:13.200 --> 08:15.520
but he insisted on doing it himself

08:16.240 --> 08:17.480
and burned one of my pots.

08:17.560 --> 08:19.280
Burned it clean through, you hear?

08:19.360 --> 08:20.560
What a waste!

09:06.040 --> 09:07.560
Go on, eat.

09:27.400 --> 09:28.800
I will stay strong.

09:34.080 --> 09:35.360
I can stay strong.

10:32.840 --> 10:35.160
It's just a lad who can't truss a chicken,

10:36.120 --> 10:37.880
yet they sent a whole crowd to tail him.

10:37.960 --> 10:39.560
They truly have nothing better to do.

11:13.840 --> 11:15.800
The Tiemo people are already in the city.

11:15.880 --> 11:17.280
People are terrified.

11:22.400 --> 11:23.600
The shadow guards

11:24.600 --> 11:26.240
they've planted in the city

11:27.560 --> 11:29.400
aren't enough to hold Chang'an.

11:31.000 --> 11:32.760
They're waiting for their troops.

11:33.360 --> 11:34.560
Until they arrive,

11:36.320 --> 11:38.240
they won't touch the common folk.

11:40.400 --> 11:42.080
You seem

11:43.000 --> 11:44.200
confident.

11:54.680 --> 11:56.360
I planned for years

11:57.760 --> 11:59.840
to return to Chang'an
and kill Yan Fengshan.

12:01.600 --> 12:03.400
But the Tiemo invasion

12:04.920 --> 12:06.280
and my kin's betrayal

12:07.520 --> 12:08.880
were beyond my calculations.

12:16.160 --> 12:17.720
Life is

12:20.000 --> 12:21.600
truly unpredictable.

12:40.160 --> 12:41.480
Tomorrow, at the Shen Hour,

12:42.600 --> 12:43.960
a wind will rise.

12:45.960 --> 12:47.240
I don't know why,

12:48.920 --> 12:51.040
but looking at you now

12:53.600 --> 12:55.040
gives me

12:55.840 --> 12:57.480
a strange feeling.

13:01.200 --> 13:02.120
‎Oh?

13:03.600 --> 13:05.040
What feeling?

13:17.640 --> 13:19.120
As if you were an old man.

13:25.120 --> 13:26.320
I am.

13:28.680 --> 13:30.200
I truly am.

13:31.960 --> 13:33.520
My parents are gone.

13:36.360 --> 13:38.080
I have no family left in this world.

13:41.320 --> 13:42.960
Living in this world,

13:46.240 --> 13:47.960
I can only cling to memories.

13:49.840 --> 13:51.400
Such days

13:55.120 --> 13:56.440
must come to an end.

13:59.640 --> 14:01.360
End? What end?

14:01.440 --> 14:02.960
Huai'an, don't say that.

14:18.760 --> 14:19.760
Silly girl.

14:21.600 --> 14:23.000
Don't worry.

14:27.000 --> 14:28.040
Heaven above,

14:28.680 --> 14:30.040
please show Huai'an

14:30.960 --> 14:32.240
some kindness.

14:35.880 --> 14:36.720
Xiaoqing,

14:39.320 --> 14:40.600
I need a walk.

14:41.760 --> 14:43.880
It's dangerous outside.

14:43.960 --> 14:44.920
Where's Zheng?

14:45.000 --> 14:45.880
Zheng…

14:45.960 --> 14:47.360
I already sent him off.

14:49.520 --> 14:51.120
I want to look around outside.

14:58.720 --> 14:59.640
All right.

15:02.920 --> 15:04.400
This pot is ruined.

15:05.040 --> 15:06.280
I need it mended.

15:07.360 --> 15:08.960
As for Heaven's kindness,

15:09.800 --> 15:10.960
we'll see.

15:12.480 --> 15:13.680
Don't tell your senior brother.

15:13.760 --> 15:14.880
Let's go.

15:25.680 --> 15:31.600
EARTHENWARE

15:35.920 --> 15:37.000
Huai'an,

15:37.080 --> 15:39.120
they sell new pots here.

15:40.400 --> 15:41.680
Let's take a look inside.

15:47.920 --> 15:49.640
Sir, why is there so much smoke?

15:49.720 --> 15:51.600
Do you mend pots, or do you cook?

15:51.680 --> 15:54.400
Three chi down the alley
is an eatery's kitchen.

15:54.480 --> 15:56.400
When they start cooking,
the smoke drifts over.

15:57.680 --> 16:00.080
Huai'an, I don't think
they mend pots here.

16:01.480 --> 16:02.640
Let's ask.

16:05.360 --> 16:06.200
Sir,

16:06.760 --> 16:07.800
my pot is broken.

16:07.880 --> 16:09.480
Take a look.

16:09.560 --> 16:10.640
Can you mend it?

16:14.120 --> 16:15.160
I can.

16:15.240 --> 16:17.280
When do you want it done? Today?

16:19.920 --> 16:20.960
Not today.

16:21.800 --> 16:22.840
I'm too tired to walk.

16:24.600 --> 16:25.600
Tomorrow.

16:26.280 --> 16:28.360
Tomorrow? At night?

16:29.080 --> 16:30.480
Not at night.

16:31.800 --> 16:33.120
Tomorrow, at the Shen hour.

16:34.040 --> 16:35.080
Shen hour?

16:35.720 --> 16:37.520
Very well. I'll have it done then.

16:39.040 --> 16:40.000
My thanks.

16:40.680 --> 16:41.840
Think nothing of it.

16:43.480 --> 16:44.320
‎Let's go.

16:50.560 --> 16:51.840
Huai'an,

16:51.920 --> 16:54.600
there was something odd about that man.

16:55.200 --> 16:56.240
How so?

16:57.160 --> 17:00.040
He almost seemed

17:00.920 --> 17:02.360
afraid of you.

17:03.480 --> 17:04.680
You're overthinking things.

17:05.520 --> 17:07.079
Come with me to a clinic.

17:07.160 --> 17:11.359
TEA AND HORSE POST

17:15.200 --> 17:17.280
If we could return
to the Imperial Physician's Hall,

17:17.359 --> 17:19.040
we wouldn't need to go to another clinic.

17:20.000 --> 17:23.319
Can a clinic in a place like this
really be trusted?

17:24.440 --> 17:25.480
Yes.

17:26.040 --> 17:27.440
Your senior brother's life
was saved there.

17:28.079 --> 17:29.080
Really?

17:30.640 --> 17:32.000
Yi Zhihu.

17:32.080 --> 17:33.360
Yi Zhihu is real?

17:33.920 --> 17:35.880
How did you meet this physician?

17:36.480 --> 17:38.160
I've been hunted for years.

17:38.240 --> 17:41.160
One winter, Yi crossed paths with me
and saved me.

17:41.680 --> 17:44.560
Yi said she'd never seen
obsession as deep as mine,

17:44.640 --> 17:45.960
and wished to see how it would end.

17:50.440 --> 17:51.760
Yi Zhihu,

17:52.600 --> 17:54.080
you're a woman?

17:56.840 --> 17:58.520
I thought Yi would be some ugly old man.

18:01.800 --> 18:05.320
Rumor says that a northern healer,
hideous of face,

18:05.960 --> 18:07.800
can bring the dying back to life

18:09.040 --> 18:10.760
and wed a young bride at 50.

18:11.360 --> 18:14.600
But in truth, Yi Zhihu is a woman.

18:16.080 --> 18:17.560
The ugly one

18:17.640 --> 18:19.080
is her helper.

18:20.040 --> 18:21.520
Those who come to me

18:21.600 --> 18:23.680
have all been to the verge of death.

18:23.760 --> 18:25.720
Without a few tricks,

18:25.800 --> 18:26.960
I couldn't have survived.

18:28.120 --> 18:30.320
Treating your senior brother last time,
for example,

18:30.400 --> 18:32.480
drew the Huben guards upon me.

18:36.160 --> 18:37.120
Step out, will you?

18:38.680 --> 18:39.920
Why should I?

18:41.840 --> 18:43.040
I need to examine his wounds.

19:02.840 --> 19:04.840
There is no need
to keep things from Xiaoqing.

19:04.920 --> 19:07.240
There's nothing she can't know.

19:07.320 --> 19:08.680
Is that so?

19:09.360 --> 19:11.280
Seems to me you're still
hiding something from her.

19:13.880 --> 19:15.240
Where is he?

19:39.640 --> 19:41.160
The King of Tiemo is in Chang'an.

19:42.080 --> 19:43.360
Is your blade ready?

19:45.040 --> 19:46.960
With the enemy at the gates,

19:48.400 --> 19:50.840
killing him alone won't be enough.

19:52.640 --> 19:54.400
I've devised a plan

19:56.040 --> 19:58.800
to kill every Tiemo invader.

20:03.200 --> 20:04.920
Do you have enough forces?

20:07.880 --> 20:08.760
Of course.

20:29.120 --> 20:30.080
-General.
-General.

20:30.840 --> 20:32.040
-General.
-General.

20:33.840 --> 20:34.880
Where are the others?

20:35.560 --> 20:38.520
Have my orders
lost all weight in this camp?

20:39.200 --> 20:40.120
General,

20:40.200 --> 20:43.240
-the other officers are gone.
-What did you say?

20:43.320 --> 20:45.800
The other officers and their men

20:45.880 --> 20:47.160
have vanished.

20:49.200 --> 20:50.480
Have they deserted?

20:50.560 --> 20:51.760
Then track them down!

20:53.880 --> 20:56.080
General, it's been nearly five days.

20:56.760 --> 20:58.840
We have no trail to follow.

21:09.400 --> 21:10.320
Xiang Xuehuai!

21:15.120 --> 21:16.240
‎Please.

21:16.320 --> 21:19.600
How are you still drinking tea?

21:19.680 --> 21:20.560
Look,

21:21.280 --> 21:22.440
he caught us.

21:24.600 --> 21:26.280
This is Mr. Xie Huai'an's friend,

21:26.360 --> 21:27.680
Ye Zheng.

21:27.760 --> 21:30.080
He's brought Mr. Xie's command.

21:31.160 --> 21:32.360
Whatever the order is,

21:32.920 --> 21:34.480
we have a greater internal crisis.

21:35.200 --> 21:36.680
Do you realize what is happening?

21:37.360 --> 21:38.800
Six entire units have disappeared!

21:40.760 --> 21:42.000
I know that.

21:42.080 --> 21:44.280
That was due to Mr. Xie's first order.

21:45.520 --> 21:46.440
Then why not tell me?

21:47.760 --> 21:49.080
Calm yourself.

21:49.680 --> 21:52.080
I know your temper, so I held back.

21:52.880 --> 21:56.640
The messenger that day
was from the Huben Army.

22:02.160 --> 22:03.480
This letter is from Xie Huai'an.

22:04.320 --> 22:05.560
If we follow his strategy,

22:06.280 --> 22:07.120
we may

22:07.800 --> 22:09.600
have a chance to defeat the Tiemo.

22:10.840 --> 22:11.800
Farewell.

22:12.720 --> 22:13.560
Wait.

22:16.320 --> 22:17.800
Why are you helping us?

22:18.640 --> 22:21.040
You are soldiers. So are we.

22:22.400 --> 22:24.640
That's why Xie Huai'an trusts me.

22:26.480 --> 22:27.920
Where will you go next?

22:28.880 --> 22:30.960
The four regional commanders
hold massive forces.

22:31.040 --> 22:32.280
I will carry Xie Huai'an's order

22:32.360 --> 22:33.880
to each of them.

22:47.400 --> 22:50.400
Five days ago,
Mr. Xie Huai'an secretly ordered me

22:50.480 --> 22:53.360
to send out our finest troops.

22:53.440 --> 22:55.000
Where were they sent?

22:57.240 --> 22:58.760
They're all in Chang'an.

24:21.080 --> 24:24.320
When do we strike, and what is the signal?

24:24.400 --> 24:25.680
Tomorrow

24:26.720 --> 24:27.760
at the Shen hour.

24:30.000 --> 24:31.360
The wind will rise.

24:52.000 --> 24:53.200
Where have you been?

24:57.120 --> 24:58.920
Zheng, how thoughtful you are.

24:59.000 --> 25:00.040
You look grumpy,

25:00.120 --> 25:01.680
but the congee you made smells wonderful.

25:01.760 --> 25:02.720
Thank you.

25:03.320 --> 25:04.600
You and that mouth of yours.

25:06.640 --> 25:08.720
Come in. The food's ready.

25:21.880 --> 25:23.600
Tiemo shadow guards
won't risk alerting us.

25:24.400 --> 25:26.680
If they're walking openly with axes,

25:26.760 --> 25:28.080
they're likely just neighbors.

25:31.200 --> 25:32.240
Come on.

25:38.960 --> 25:39.880
Cen Pickles!

25:43.720 --> 25:44.920
Is Cen Pickles not home?

25:45.560 --> 25:46.840
Why are you here?

25:46.920 --> 25:48.160
For a meal!

25:48.240 --> 25:49.960
You've run out of grain already?

25:50.040 --> 25:51.280
We're saving it.

25:51.360 --> 25:53.520
Once the war begins,
supplies may be cut off at any moment.

25:53.600 --> 25:56.360
We'll eat his grain first, then ours.
Come on.

25:57.880 --> 25:59.720
Shameless.

26:01.560 --> 26:02.600
You flatter us.

26:44.120 --> 26:46.040
-Your Majesty.
-Have you found Xie Huai'an?

26:47.440 --> 26:48.440
Not yet.

26:48.520 --> 26:50.720
We're sending more men to search.

26:51.680 --> 26:53.760
He's Liu Ziwen's son.

26:54.440 --> 26:55.960
Everything

26:56.760 --> 26:59.160
the Huben Army learned, he learned.

26:59.960 --> 27:03.080
Finding him won't be easy.

27:05.440 --> 27:06.920
There is another matter

27:07.000 --> 27:09.280
-Your Majesty may want to hear.
-Speak.

27:09.360 --> 27:11.240
Sha from the wonton stall

27:11.840 --> 27:14.840
treated Xiao Wenjing to a bowl of rice.

27:16.840 --> 27:18.120
Rice?

27:18.200 --> 27:19.080
Yes.

27:20.760 --> 27:22.080
He used the chance

27:22.680 --> 27:25.920
to see how many of us
were tailing Xiao Wenjing.

27:32.440 --> 27:35.440
They may act soon.

27:36.640 --> 27:38.240
Then we've likely

27:39.800 --> 27:42.160
found Xie Huai'an.

27:44.040 --> 27:46.240
And Cen Weizong.

28:07.840 --> 28:08.880
Thank you.

28:08.960 --> 28:10.400
All right, that's enough.

28:10.480 --> 28:11.560
Full?

28:11.640 --> 28:12.840
-Yes.
-Good. We're leaving!

28:12.920 --> 28:14.360
-We'll take the clay pot tomorrow.
-We're leaving.

28:14.440 --> 28:16.440
-Keep this for me.
-We're leaving.

28:16.520 --> 28:17.960
I'll come back tomorrow.

28:18.040 --> 28:19.840
-We're leaving, sir.
-Be careful.

28:19.920 --> 28:20.960
Come on.

28:25.040 --> 28:27.280
Your neighbors in Ronghua Alley

28:27.360 --> 28:29.200
are treating your home
like it's a granary.

28:33.360 --> 28:34.400
Those you saw,

28:36.360 --> 28:37.680
and those who didn't come today,

28:38.960 --> 28:41.000
come here to eat whenever they like.

28:41.600 --> 28:42.960
I gave them nicknames:

28:43.640 --> 28:44.680
Gulouzi,

28:45.480 --> 28:47.000
Gourd Chicken,

28:47.080 --> 28:49.280
Noodle Soup, and Boiled Lamb.

28:52.080 --> 28:54.040
Food is the primary need of the people.

28:54.920 --> 28:55.960
When grain runs out,

28:56.680 --> 28:57.520
their world collapses.

29:02.600 --> 29:04.240
Sha told me

29:05.920 --> 29:07.320
that in the old days,

29:07.400 --> 29:09.400
the founding emperor, you, my father,

29:09.480 --> 29:11.000
and Wu Zhongheng

29:11.720 --> 29:13.680
often gathered in that little shop

29:14.480 --> 29:15.720
for a bowl of wontons.

29:17.080 --> 29:18.920
Sha worked all night

29:19.000 --> 29:20.880
and barely earned a few coins.

29:22.640 --> 29:24.160
So he complained?

29:25.520 --> 29:26.960
But he's right.

29:28.480 --> 29:29.800
It's been nearly 20 years.

29:30.400 --> 29:32.920
Among the few of us, I'm the one
who achieved the least.

29:34.200 --> 29:36.280
But I enjoyed being with my friends.

29:51.480 --> 29:52.920
Wu Zhongheng

29:54.720 --> 29:56.400
is now the King of Tiemo.

30:04.360 --> 30:06.080
Are you still friends?

30:16.360 --> 30:17.400
Most likely not.

30:19.680 --> 30:21.080
After your father

30:22.680 --> 30:24.640
hung the red silk on the hemlock tree,

30:25.760 --> 30:27.360
I never showed up again.

30:28.680 --> 30:30.840
Wu Zhongheng must have known then
that I belonged

30:30.920 --> 30:31.960
to the Liu faction.

30:36.720 --> 30:37.960
If we were still friends,

30:38.640 --> 30:40.600
I could have walked into his courtyard
to kill him,

30:41.280 --> 30:43.280
regardless of the outcome.

30:46.120 --> 30:47.520
The Grand Preceptor cannot die.

30:50.520 --> 30:51.520
As for killing him,

30:53.760 --> 30:55.200
I already have a plan.

31:33.920 --> 31:35.000
Are you hungry?

31:36.360 --> 31:37.200
Want some congee?

31:38.320 --> 31:40.360
-Here.
-No, thanks. You go on and eat.

31:40.440 --> 31:41.320
I'm not hungry.

31:42.440 --> 31:44.400
Then why the long face?

31:48.440 --> 31:49.440
I feel uneasy.

32:59.520 --> 33:00.800
It's freezing out there,

33:01.720 --> 33:03.240
yet he sits alone like that.

33:06.040 --> 33:07.560
He'll catch a cold.

33:07.640 --> 33:09.280
-I'll call him back.
-Don't.

33:12.800 --> 33:14.040
We'd better

33:15.200 --> 33:16.480
let him be.

33:29.480 --> 33:33.240
YOU HOUR

33:52.840 --> 33:54.680
-Open the door.
-Yes.

34:15.840 --> 34:17.520
My men have been negligent.

34:18.560 --> 34:20.639
You are, after all,
about to be an emperor.

34:21.440 --> 34:23.520
How could they serve you a meal like this?

34:27.120 --> 34:28.800
The empire is collapsing.

34:31.239 --> 34:32.920
What emperor?

34:34.360 --> 34:36.480
It's only a show,

34:38.840 --> 34:40.400
with me playing the monkey

34:42.560 --> 34:43.560
for the Tiemo people.

34:45.760 --> 34:47.280
This is the peace treaty I drafted.

34:49.880 --> 34:51.159
Accept it,

34:51.239 --> 34:52.800
and you can save your nation,

34:53.320 --> 34:54.880
Your Majesty.

35:12.800 --> 35:14.000
FIRST, THE TWO NATIONS
SHALL BE AS BROTHERS.

35:14.080 --> 35:15.320
SECOND, THE THREE PREFECTURES NORTH
OF THE NORTH OFFICE ARE CEDED TO TIEMO.

35:15.400 --> 35:17.440
"All land north of the North Office

35:18.520 --> 35:20.280
belongs to Tiemo…"

35:27.960 --> 35:31.440
"Annual tribute: 250,000 liang of gold,

35:32.280 --> 35:34.280
250,000 liang of silver,

35:35.200 --> 35:37.040
100,000 horses,

35:37.640 --> 35:39.280
300,000 bolts of silk,

35:43.640 --> 35:46.520
900,000 DAN OF GRAIN

35:52.120 --> 35:53.960
and 900,000 dan of grain…"

35:59.880 --> 36:02.440
Even the fertile fields of Ganzhou

36:03.640 --> 36:05.920
yield only 200,000 dan a year.

36:07.880 --> 36:09.640
Huzhou, Huai'an, and the others

36:10.800 --> 36:13.640
yield less than 100,000 dan a year.

36:17.400 --> 36:19.560
Yet you demand 900,000 in tribute?

36:22.480 --> 36:24.920
You call this a peace treaty?

36:28.240 --> 36:30.200
Isn't this

36:30.280 --> 36:34.160
just turning my people into your slaves
and livestock?

36:44.760 --> 36:46.720
Past Xigu Mountain City,

36:47.480 --> 36:49.800
Chang'an has no natural defenses left.

36:50.400 --> 36:53.880
My main forces are just 300 li away.

36:56.520 --> 36:57.960
When they arrive,

36:58.040 --> 36:59.480
the well-off people of Chang'an

36:59.560 --> 37:02.200
won't just be slaves or livestock.

37:03.000 --> 37:05.120
Even the chance to stay alive

37:07.040 --> 37:09.080
won't belong to everyone.

37:16.640 --> 37:17.680
Tomorrow,

37:18.240 --> 37:19.560
tear off that mask of yours,

37:20.160 --> 37:22.280
show yourself as the Emperor of Chang'an,

37:23.400 --> 37:25.360
and sit on your throne.

37:26.440 --> 37:28.920
We will seal this treaty by exchanging

37:29.720 --> 37:31.600
letters of credence.

37:33.200 --> 37:34.120
In return,

37:35.720 --> 37:38.160
your people will live.

37:54.880 --> 37:56.720
I was once a useless emperor,

37:59.600 --> 38:01.320
blind to the sufferings of the people.

38:05.320 --> 38:06.840
But now I understand.

38:09.440 --> 38:10.600
A bowl of rice

38:11.680 --> 38:12.880
or a single flatbread

38:14.080 --> 38:15.960
can be the line between life and death.

38:22.400 --> 38:24.640
If you can't even give them that,

38:28.120 --> 38:29.480
then attack.

38:35.720 --> 38:37.680
When you do, the people of Chang'an

38:41.560 --> 38:44.120
will die fighting with you.

39:00.440 --> 39:01.680
You can try.

39:02.400 --> 39:03.440
If you lose,

39:03.960 --> 39:06.280
Chang'an will be a wasteland.

39:21.200 --> 39:22.240
Monster.

39:27.680 --> 39:29.480
And so am I.

40:46.320 --> 40:49.280
Huai'an, why are you sharpening my blade?

41:04.320 --> 41:06.680
Here. It's done.

41:18.440 --> 41:19.480
Huai'an,

41:20.560 --> 41:21.640
you're acting strangely today.

41:23.320 --> 41:24.840
Are you hiding something from me?

41:24.920 --> 41:26.040
No.

41:26.840 --> 41:29.560
You're the one hiding something.

41:35.120 --> 41:37.560
The pageboy is locked
in the Imperial Guard Station.

41:37.640 --> 41:39.040
You scouted out the place, right?

41:39.120 --> 41:40.400
So?

41:40.480 --> 41:41.960
Did you find a way to rescue him?

41:43.040 --> 41:44.320
You knew?

41:46.600 --> 41:48.280
We're friends.

41:48.360 --> 41:50.520
How could I not know what you're thinking?

41:54.200 --> 41:55.440
I'm not confident.

41:55.520 --> 41:57.480
There are too many guards.
It's hard to break in.

41:58.160 --> 41:59.960
Once the Shen-hour plan begins,

42:00.040 --> 42:02.360
the Tiemo people will kill him
the moment they feel threatened.

42:02.440 --> 42:03.480
He won't die.

42:04.720 --> 42:06.200
Give me one battalion.

42:06.280 --> 42:08.960
I will take the station within two hours.

42:09.040 --> 42:11.520
If you storm it, he may truly die.

42:14.440 --> 42:15.680
Ye Zheng,

42:17.160 --> 42:18.560
the Shen-hour plan

42:19.320 --> 42:20.760
cannot afford

42:21.520 --> 42:23.040
a single misstep.

42:23.800 --> 42:24.760
Therefore,

42:25.280 --> 42:28.240
you must appear at the exact place
I designated for you

42:29.800 --> 42:30.840
and wait for me there.

42:33.400 --> 42:34.640
I will

42:35.480 --> 42:36.440
rescue the pageboy.

42:37.840 --> 42:38.960
How?

42:42.360 --> 42:43.400
Yesterday,

42:44.440 --> 42:46.840
I had Sha serve him a bowl of rice.

42:46.920 --> 42:48.280
I let the Tiemo see it on purpose

42:48.360 --> 42:49.760
so they'd believe

42:50.480 --> 42:51.960
I intended to rescue him.

42:53.080 --> 42:54.160
That means today,

42:55.160 --> 42:56.200
the pageboy will be forced

42:57.320 --> 42:59.000
to exchange letters of credence with Tiemo

42:59.560 --> 43:00.840
as the Emperor of Chang'an,

43:01.840 --> 43:05.360
and the best moment to act is when he is

43:06.040 --> 43:07.760
on his way to the palace.

43:10.160 --> 43:13.280
But why expose such a flaw?

43:13.360 --> 43:15.000
It's the only

43:15.640 --> 43:17.440
and the most convincing way.

43:18.440 --> 43:19.480
Only by doing so

43:20.360 --> 43:23.080
can the Shen-hour plan remain concealed.

43:24.080 --> 43:25.480
No. Absolutely not.

43:25.560 --> 43:27.480
You will expose yourself.

43:27.560 --> 43:28.800
You will be risking your life!

43:30.640 --> 43:32.040
It is a life for a life.

43:33.720 --> 43:34.560
Ye Zheng,

43:35.280 --> 43:37.200
if you were the one in danger,

43:37.920 --> 43:39.120
I would do the same.

43:41.680 --> 43:43.200
-But…
-Enough.

43:43.800 --> 43:45.080
No more arguing.

43:46.040 --> 43:48.000
If we do manage to
drive out the Tiemo people,

43:48.080 --> 43:50.880
don't forget to reunite with Zhaolu.

43:53.920 --> 43:55.320
I will.

43:55.400 --> 43:57.480
When all this ends, I will find her.

43:57.560 --> 44:00.240
But until then, I must keep you safe.

44:00.320 --> 44:01.880
If anything happens to you,

44:01.960 --> 44:03.040
what do I live for?

44:13.800 --> 44:14.840
I know

44:16.360 --> 44:17.640
that once you decide something,

44:18.920 --> 44:20.120
no one can sway you.

44:21.400 --> 44:22.480
Since I began following you,

44:23.360 --> 44:25.280
I've never questioned your decisions

44:26.520 --> 44:29.680
or faltered in carrying out your orders.

44:29.760 --> 44:31.280
But this is different.

44:31.360 --> 44:33.440
You're walking straight into death.

44:35.240 --> 44:36.280
Huai'an,

44:38.160 --> 44:40.280
sometimes you should put yourself first.

44:54.240 --> 44:55.280
Huai'an,

44:56.800 --> 44:58.400
your hair…

45:04.920 --> 45:06.280
I was born white-haired,

45:07.280 --> 45:08.520
and I'll die white-haired.

45:11.080 --> 45:12.320
What is there to fear?

45:24.400 --> 45:25.440
All right,

45:26.040 --> 45:27.080
time for me to go.

45:27.840 --> 45:29.040
At the Shen hour,

45:29.640 --> 45:30.920
we'll meet again.

46:12.640 --> 46:14.760
Zheng. Zheng…

46:16.200 --> 46:17.240
Master once said

46:20.280 --> 46:21.640
that he was born white-haired.

46:23.800 --> 46:25.080
The Grand Preceptor divined

46:27.080 --> 46:28.520
that he would live

46:30.680 --> 46:31.920
until his hair turned white again.

46:39.560 --> 46:41.320
Looks like his mind is set.
